# ---- Node / Svelte (frontend) ----
# NOTE: do NOT blanket-ignore `build/` here. That is the tamp build-script project
# at the repo root (build/Build.cs). Scope SvelteKit's adapter-static output to the
# frontend path instead when the frontend lands (e.g. src/frontend/build/).
node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
.vite/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

